<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment Invoice</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f7f6;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e, #0d9488);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    .content h2 {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    .invoice-details {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border-left: 4px solid #0d9488;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .invoice-details p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .invoice-details strong {
      color: #1e293b;
      display: inline-block;
      width: 140px;
    }
    .btn-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0d9488;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #0f766e;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Payment Successful</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Hello <%= patientName %>,</h2>
      <p>Thank you for choosing our healthcare services. Your payment has been successfully processed.</p>
      
      <div class="invoice-details">
        <p><strong>Amount Paid:</strong> BDT <%= amount %></p>
        <p><strong>Doctor:</strong> <%= doctorName %></p>
        <p><strong>Appointment Date:</strong> <%= appointmentDate %></p>
        <p><strong>Payment Date:</strong> <%= paymentDate %></p>
        <p><strong>Transaction ID:</strong> <%= transactionId %></p>
        <p><strong>Invoice ID:</strong> <%= invoiceId %></p>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 15px;">Your appointment has been confirmed. You can download the official PDF invoice by clicking the button below:</p>

      <div class="btn-container">
        <a href="<%= invoiceUrl %>" class="btn" download>Download Invoice PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> HealthCare System. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
